# Repeated passages: complete author review

A group is one identical authored verse at two printed addresses. All occurrences remain unchanged. Source presence does not establish intention. No repetition is approved merely by appearing in this list.

Total: 67 groups; 134 printed occurrences. Each column preserves its own exact decoded working-edition string; table line breaks are presentation only. PDF checks ignore whitespace.

Society 42/43 and Identity 13/14 are nearly repeated chapters, not interchangeable chapters: Society 42:4 and Identity 13:4 have missing text, and Identity 13:25/14:25 differ by the word "neither". Do not copy, delete, merge, or renumber chapters from this table.

## inquiry 41 / society 41 (2 groups)

| Finding | First occurrence | Second occurrence | Author decision |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| source-warning-066 | inquiry:41:3 (PDF 65)<br>Many defend the ways of their fathers; few ask whether their fathers were correct. | society:41:2 (PDF 307)<br>Many defend the ways of their fathers; few ask whether their fathers were correct. | accepted; intent AUTHOR_CONFIRMED |
| source-warning-067 | inquiry:41:6 (PDF 65)<br>Count not heads before examining reasons; the crowd often follows confidence; wisdom follows evidence. | society:41:4 (PDF 307)<br>Count not heads before examining reasons; the crowd often follows confidence; wisdom follows evidence. | accepted; intent AUTHOR_CONFIRMED |

## freedom 34 / society 41 (8 groups)

